        "reviewBody": "Let&#039;s face it - nobody really likes going to the dentist, but the whole team of West LA Implants makes this experience very pleasurable. Their office must be such a great place to work because everyone is so friendly!  They truly feel like a team and make you feel very special by going above and beyond. By saying that, they don&#039;t push you for any more procedures, but really try to address your concerns and deal with them in the best possible way.  I had an annual checkup and teeth cleaning appointment with Anisa Seysan, who is a top-notch dental hygienist with a wonderful personality and excellent bedside manners. She&#039;s very thorough and caring. Exceptional dental experience!",
