      "description": [
        "West LA Implants is a cosmetic and implant dental office in Los Angeles, California Westwood and Brentwood California. We serve as a westwood dentist office, brentwood dentist office and santa monica dentist, and mid city dental. We provide top of the line dental implants, &amp; cosmetic dentistry in West LA area. Make sure to check us out and give us a call today at 310 481-0111 As a dentist in brentwood, we provide some of the best dental implants and are led by a lead dental implant provider of los angeles, Dr. Tony Barriere, a member of the GDIA, where they teach dental implants and the placement of dental implants los angeles."
